00:23:12,000 --> 00:23:14,000
are not all to your credit either.

581
00:23:14,000 --> 00:23:16,000
And finally, I

582
00:23:16,000 --> 00:23:18,000
would say, 25 years from now,

583
00:23:18,000 --> 00:23:20,000
you're going to be happy that you're stuck with it.

